{"id":"rva3-027","question":"16GB 是否是系统的并发用户数量？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"be386c48-2c17-426c-90db-7baa8e007d7f","document_logical_name":"第 7 课：工程化专题 + 面试实战","heading_path":["第 7 课：工程化专题 + 面试实战","一、教案正文","7.7 学完整个项目后应该形成的认知"],"span_text":"> AgentMentor 的核心价值不是\"用大模型生成三道题\"，而是把学习资料、可溯源检索、人机工作流、可信评分和长期画像连接成一个受约束的训练闭环。系统通过应用层规则限制 LLM 的权力，通过 checkpoint 和幂等保证流程状态，通过两层画像控制长期记忆粒度，再通过增量知识目录区分\"回答得怎么样\"和\"资料是否考到\"，形成补缺与查漏两类训练信号；并在 16GB 本地约束下选择 PostgreSQL、本地 BGE-small-zh 和模块化单体。它已经是一个真实可运行的个人学习系统，但还不是企业级终态；当前已补同知识库最近历史题目冷却，全量语义题库去重、复杂文档、生产检索评测、租户权限和可靠异步任务是明确的演进方向。","span_sha256":"9c6fb761ea2a1739f00abb188cd5d6a38fc76d67bf875366af4d5026607873ad","source_content_hash":"ef0ab6bdde4cdd1972bb8535c0e6afd9172fc5ede2b75b72bec28239ce729c11"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":null,"confusion_type":null,"primary_relation_role":null,"primary_span_type":null,"demands":[],"rationale":null}}
{"id":"rva3-028","question":"示例里的 13 是否是评分接口的 P95 延迟？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"141180c3-1581-420e-aabc-aa107e3a7083","document_logical_name":"第 5 课：可信评分与报告","heading_path":["第 5 课：可信评分与报告","一、教案正文","5.3 应用层重算总分"],"span_text":"\n```python\ndef total_score(output: EvaluationOutput) -> int:\n    return output.correctness + output.completeness + output.reasoning + output.communication\n```\n\n写入数据库时：\n\n```python\nevaluation = EvaluationModel(\n    correctness=output.correctness,\n    ...,\n    total=total_score(output),       # ← 应用层重算，不读 LLM 返回的 total\n)\n```\n\n原因：LLM 可能算错加法——`4+3+2+4=13` 但 LLM 写了 `15`。Python 的 `+` 不会错。","span_sha256":"05077122ed190de2318e4683f5b9f5802379a3539d7cdcd848f9eee4a6ce6c0a","source_content_hash":"62e9d7eb7a9dd7c12ec9ff93ac7fd07794e7e1f51b15890620db7defe44fe87b"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":null,"confusion_type":null,"primary_relation_role":null,"primary_span_type":null,"demands":[],"rationale":null}}
